 succeeded in 0ms:
     1	# Retrospective: Host Reboot Exposed Image-vs-DB Migration Drift
     2	
     3	**Date**: 2026-05-14
     4	**Type**: Incident retro (unplanned interruption + deployment pipeline gap)
     5	**Linked tickets**:
     6	- OP-1035 (CI: publish per-develop-commit images to GHCR — only half of the pipeline)
     7	- OP-1046 (Resolve alembic 0203 duplicate + merge 7 heads — drove DB to 0202)
     8	- OP-1095 (runner presync failure at interruption — stash `rescue-OP-1095-presync-fail-2026-05-14T05:10Z`)
