   203	- Not a tier-drift retro per §14 (no tier-shaped estimate to compare against — this was an unplanned external event).
   204	- Not a Sprint S12 / S12.G retro — those are still in-flight and this incident does not close them.
   205	- Not a runner-bug retro for OP-1095 — the OP-1095 stash needs its own analysis; this retro only records that the interruption *coincided* with OP-1095's self-rescue.
