- `v2-A7-Integration` is synthetic end-to-end validation of all 5 dimensions, but is tier:S (`docs/sprint-s12/sprint-s12g-A-v2-runtime-defense-contract-spec.md:306-313`).

Impact: the filing plan will understate coordination cost, operator-window needs, and evidence requirements. It also contradicts the prompt'"'s explicit tier gate.

